1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:04,570
(Sheldon-bot:)Using Photoshop, I've
introduced a few anachronisms.

2
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:06,940
(Sheldon-bot:)See if you can spot all 24.

3
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:08,440
(Sheldon-bot:)I'll give you the first one.

4
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:12,740
(Sheldon-bot:)Madame Curie should not
be wearing a digital watch.

5
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:14,110
(Sheldon-bot:)And go.

6
00:00:16,530 --> 00:00:18,150
(Leonard:)That's it. Bye-bye.

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,120
(Sheldon-bot(screen switching itself back on):)Bazinga.
Whoa!

8
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:27,510
(Sheldon-bot:)I have an override switch.

9
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:29,130
(Leonard:)I almost died!

10
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:31,630
(Sheldon-bot :)And I'm safe and sound in bed.

11
00:00:31,630 --> 00:00:33,800
(Sheldon-bot :)Who's crazy now?

12
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,500
(Leonard:)I'm still going
to go with you.

13
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:44,510
(Sheldon-bot :)Hello, Professor Hoskins.

14
00:00:44,510 --> 00:00:47,230
(Sheldon-bot :)Nice to see you, Mindy.

15
00:00:47,230 --> 00:00:50,030
And konnichiwa, Dr. Nakamora.

16
00:00:50,030 --> 00:01:00,020
(Sheldon-bot :)Sorry the Swedes
disproved your theory.

